
12.08.2008
 - Open without arguments acts now like used with "" and opens the current
   drawer. (geit)

14.06.2008
 - Added smart url detection, so simply wrong spelled filenames don't cause
   the web browser to be launched. (geit)

28.02.2008
 - Renamed to "open" to stop whining. :D (geit) If you liked "do" use alias command
   in user-startup. (geit)
 - Added open url support. (geit)
 - Added pattern matching support (use with care, as it may overload your entire system when
   opening 1000 jpg at the same time by using #?.jpg ). (geit)
 - Added multi argument parsing. (geit)

11.06.2006
 - First version of "do". Do allows to use the Ambient filetypes via
